    <h1>Cathkin Estates HOA — Master Baseline Risk Matrix & Register</h1>

    <h2>1. 5x5 Risk Evaluation Matrix</h2>
    <p><strong>Risk Score = Likelihood (1-5) x Severity (1-5)</strong></p>
    <table class="matrix-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="background-color: #2d3748;">Severity &rarr;<br>Likelihood &darr;</th>
                <th>1 - Insignificant</th>
                <th>2 - Minor</th>
                <th>3 - Moderate</th>
                <th>4 - Major</th>
                <th>5 - Catastrophic</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <th>5 - Almost Certain</th>
                <td class="risk-med">5 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">10 (High)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">15 (High)</td>
                <td class="risk-critical">20 (Critical)</td>
                <td class="risk-critical">25 (Critical)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>4 - Likely</th>
                <td class="risk-low">4 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">8 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">12 (High)</td>
                <td class="risk-critical">16 (Critical)</td>
                <td class="risk-critical">20 (Critical)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>3 - Possible</th>
                <td class="risk-low">3 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">6 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">9 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">12 (High)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">15 (High)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>2 - Unlikely</th>
                <td class="risk-low">2 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-low">4 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">6 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">8 (Med)</td>
                <td class="risk-high">10 (High)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <th>1 - Rare</th>
                <td class="risk-low">1 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-low">2 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-low">3 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-low">4 (Low)</td>
                <td class="risk-med">5 (Med)</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>2. Estate Baseline Risk Register</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Activity / Area</th>
                <th>Hazard Identified</th>
                <th>Inherent Risk Score</th>
                <th>Mandatory Risk Controls</th>
                <th>Residual Risk</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Tractor & Slasher Operations</strong></td>
                <td>PTO entanglement, rollover on steep slopes, flying debris.</td>
                <td class="risk-critical">20 (Critical)</td>
                <td>Mandatory PTO master guard, ROPS frame, pre-start checks, 50m exclusion zone for bystander residents.</td>
                <td class="risk-med">6 (Med)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Chemical Handling (Herbicides)</strong></td>
                <td>Skin absorption, eye injury, environmental contamination / spill.</td>
                <td class="risk-high">12 (High)</td>
                <td>SDS available at store, 110% bunded storage, chemical aprons, face shields, nitrile gloves, spill kit on vehicle.</td>
                <td class="risk-low">4 (Low)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Road Repairs & Asphalt Work</strong></td>
                <td>Traffic exposure, burn hazards, dust inhalation, manual lifting.</td>
                <td class="risk-high">10 (High)</td>
                <td>High-visibility vests, traffic cones, warning signage, dust masks, thermal gloves for hot-mix asphalt handling.</td>
                <td class="risk-low">3 (Low)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Workshop Maintenance</strong></td>
                <td>Power tool injuries, eye hazards, electrical shock.</td>
                <td class="risk-med">9 (Med)</td>
                <td>Monthly power tool inspection, RCCD protection, safety glasses/goggles mandatory.</td>
                <td class="risk-low">2 (Low)</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

